======================================================================
(A) n=6 character ghat(m): zeros at 3|m; sign by m mod 6
======================================================================
   m : ghat(m)      |ghat|*pi   m%6   sign   (zero iff 3|m)
   1 : -0.27566   0.86603    1     -
   2 : -0.13783   0.43301    2     -
   3 : -0.00000   0.00000    3     0
   4 : +0.06892   0.21651    4     +
   5 : +0.05513   0.17321    5     +
   6 : +0.00000   0.00000    0     0
   7 : -0.03938   0.12372    1     -
   8 : -0.03446   0.10825    2     -
   => |ghat(m)| = sqrt(3)/(2 pi m) for m not= 0 mod 3; sign: m%6 in {1,2}-> -,
      m%6 in {4,5}-> +. The mod-6 pattern = (mod-3 channel)(x)(mod-2 sign).

